collins (0.1.1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Collins is now published to ppa:episode6/stable, for Ubuntu 24.04 (noble)
    and 26.04 (resolute).
  * Install alongside agent-session-manager instead of colliding with it: the
    action icons move out of the shared hicolor theme into
    /usr/share/collins/icons, which both packages claimed copies of
    (agent-claude-symbolic.svg and tab-close-symbolic.svg).

